  description: It does not spread the plague. It carries it, gently, in a skull lantern
    at the end of a crooked staff - the way you carry a candle to bed.
  tactics: 'A d2 curtain-caster that calls Wisps in while violet waves snake down.
    Kill the adds with strays, not swords - the curtains have troughs, live in them.
    Below half it Blooms: rings join the song.'
